1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,900
三个月，
Three months

2
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,130
造出一台一米五的人形机器人。
to build a humanoid robot one and a half meters tall.

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:05,320
造它的是扎克伯格的Meta，
The builders: Zuckerberg's Meta

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,850
还有上海的傅利叶。
and Shanghai's Fourier.

5
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,580
据报道，它叫Max，
Reportedly it is called Max

6
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,080
大约四十八公斤。
and weighs about forty eight kilograms.

7
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,080
脸是一块屏幕，会做表情，
Its face is a screen that makes expressions,

8
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,690
还有五根手指的手。
and it has five fingered hands.

9
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,920
Meta的团队专门飞到中国，
Meta's team flew to China,

10
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,060
一位副总裁在傅利叶的工厂待了快两个月。
and a vice president spent almost two months at Fourier's factory.

11
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,550
今天的烧脑问题：
Today's brain teaser:

12
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:24,000
一个两条腿的铁家伙，凭什么站着不摔？
how does a two legged machine stand without falling?

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,580
答案可能吓你一跳：
The answer may surprise you:

14
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,100
它其实一直在摔。
it is falling all the time.

15
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,170
先玩个游戏：
Try a game:

16
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:30,260
把一把扫把立在手心上。
balance a broom on your palm.

17
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:30,950
手不动，
Keep your hand still,

18
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:32,300
扫把马上就倒。
and the broom topples right away.

19
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,540
你得一直挪手，
You have to keep moving your hand,

20
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:35,090
追着它倒的方向。
chasing the way it falls.

21
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:37,010
物理学家管这叫倒立摆：
Physicists call it an inverted pendulum:

22
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:38,880
重心在上，支点在下。
weight on top, pivot at the bottom.

23
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,650
两条腿站着的机器人，
A robot standing on two legs

24
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:43,060
就是一把会自己挪手的扫把。
is a broom that moves its own hand.

25
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,280
规矩只有一条：
There is one rule:

26
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:47,360
重心要落在脚底板围成的那块地方里。
the center of mass must stay over the area under its feet.

27
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,630
重心一出界，
Once the center of mass leaves that area,

28
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:49,820
就开始倒。
it starts to fall.

29
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:52,340
反转一：高一点，反而好平衡。
Twist one: taller is easier.

30
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,440
长扫把比铅笔好立多了。
A long broom is easier to balance than a pencil.

31
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,170
因为越高，倒得越慢，
Because taller things fall slower,

32
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:57,840
你有更多时间去接。
you get more time to catch them.

33
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,970
估算一下：一米五的个子，重心大约在腰，
A rough estimate: for a one and a half meter body, the center of mass is near the waist.

34
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:03,730
不管它的话，一秒左右就躺地上了。
Left alone, it hits the floor in about a second.

35
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:05,240
所以机器人得飞快地
So a robot must check very fast

36
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:06,700
检查自己歪没歪。
whether it is tilting.

37
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:08,340
它肚子里有个陀螺仪，
It has a gyroscope inside,

38
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:11,080
就像你耳朵里管平衡的那个小器官。
like the balance organ in your inner ear.

39
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,640
脚底还有传感器，
Sensors in the feet

40
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,320
感觉力压在哪儿。
feel where the weight presses.

41
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,900
一般的人形机器人，
A typical humanoid robot

42
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,650
每秒要这样调几百次甚至上千次。
adjusts like this hundreds or even thousands of times a second.

43
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:20,260
反转二：所以大脑必须
Twist two: so the brain must ride

44
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:21,990
装在机器人自己身上。
inside the robot itself.

45
00:01:21,990 --> 00:01:23,610
要是靠网络问云端，
If it had to ask the cloud,

46
00:01:23,610 --> 00:01:26,610
来回一趟可能就要几十到上百毫秒。
one round trip could take tens to hundreds of milliseconds.

47
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:27,660
等答案回来，
By the time the answer came back,

48
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:29,020
人已经躺下了。
the robot would be lying down.

49
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:31,650
Max用的是英伟达的Thor芯片，
Max uses Nvidia's Thor chip,

50
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:32,860
直接装在身上。
built right into its body.

51
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:34,280
走路就更刺激了：
Walking is even wilder:

52
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,190
每一步都是先往前倒。
every step starts with falling forward.

53
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:37,700
然后伸出一只脚，
Then a foot swings out

54
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,960
把自己接住。
and catches it.

55
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,440
走路，就是一路摔、
Walking is falling

56
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:41,700
一路接住自己。
and catching yourself, again and again.

57
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,370
你每天也是这么走的，
You walk this way every day too.

58
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:44,820
只是你早就忘了。
You just forgot.

59
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:46,740
反转三：最难的不是站，
Twist three: the hardest part is not standing.

60
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:47,550
是楼梯。
It is stairs.

61
00:01:47,550 --> 00:01:49,780
脚下的地面突然变了高度，
The ground suddenly changes height,

62
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:51,190
它得提前看见。
and it has to see that coming.

63
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:53,720
据报道，Max 2九月就开工了，
Reportedly, Max 2 started in September,

64
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,740
加了帮它上楼梯的传感器。
with extra sensors to help it on stairs.

65
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:57,870
还换了新躯干、更好的手，
Plus a new torso, better hands,

66
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:59,410
甚至加了投影仪。
and even a projector.

67
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:02,380
Meta想让它当自家AI Muse的身体，
Meta wants it to be a body for its AI, Muse,

68
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:03,630
将来帮忙做家务。
and someday help with chores.

69
00:02:03,630 --> 00:02:04,800
想想那个画面：
Picture it:

70
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,260
AI终于有了腿。
AI finally gets legs.

71
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,800
然后它第一件事，
And the first thing it has to learn

72
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,260
是学会别摔跤。
is not to fall.

73
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:10,820
三个月能造这么快，
Building it in three months

74
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:13,710
也说明中国的机器人供应链多成熟。
also shows how mature China's robot supply chain is.

75
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:15,720
傅利叶自己也做人形机器人，
Fourier makes its own humanoids too,

76
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:18,630
比如一米六五高的陪护机器人GR-3。
like GR-3, a one hundred sixty five centimeter care robot.

77
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:21,070
友情提示：这些都来自媒体报道，
Fine print: all of this comes from media reports.

78
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:23,950
Meta说原型只做内部研究，不卖。
Meta says the prototypes are for research, not for sale.

79
00:02:23,950 --> 00:02:25,890
一秒倒地、每秒几百次，
One second to fall, hundreds of checks a second:

80
00:02:25,890 --> 00:02:29,540
是一般情况的估算，不是Max的官方参数。
these are general estimates, not Max's official specs.

81
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:32,510
所以，三个月造的机器人，凭啥不摔？
So how does a robot built in three months not fall?

82
00:02:32,510 --> 00:02:36,130
它一刻不停地在摔，又一刻不停地接住自己。
It never stops falling, and never stops catching itself.

83
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:37,030
跟你一样。
Just like you.

84
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:39,900
只不过它还在学，你已经会了。
It is still learning. You already know how.

